<title>USA: Colorado Interstate Gas sells $100 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Colorado Interstate Gas sells $100 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Colorado Interstate Gas was priced on Tuesday via lead manager Chase Securities Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER COLORADO INTERSTATE GAS</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.85 PCT   MATURITY 6/15/2037</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.85 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 43 BP	PUTABLE IN 2007</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
